    <panel_attributes>Stage 2 class diagram (implemented system, Nov 2026)
--
All classes are in the Java package com.studyagent; the boxes above group them by layer, as in Stage 1.
Patterns: MVC (MainGUI / CLIView -&gt; StudyController -&gt; StudyService), Builder (Prompt::PromptBuilder),
Facade (LLMFacade), Proxy (GeminiProxy : LLMClient), Singleton (GeminiClient), Factory (LearningActivityFactory).
New since Stage 1: StudyService, KnowledgeRepository, SummarizationService, RecommendationService,
KnowledgeGraph, ProgressRepository, ConversationMemory, ExportService.
Removed since Stage 1: View, CourseController, CourseService, StudyRepository, ResultRepository,
ProgressAnalyzer, QuizGrader, ResponseParser, AnswerEvaluation, StudyAgentApp, Course, Material,
Concept, StudySession, Question, QuestionResult, LearningSession, Difficulty, QuizType, QuestionType, GradingStatus.
Renamed / reshaped: CLI -&gt; CLIView; PromptBuilder -&gt; nested Prompt::PromptBuilder; QuizResult -&gt; ProgressRepository::QuizResult;
LearningSession -&gt; ConversationMemory::Exchange; QuizGrader.grade -&gt; Quiz.grade; ProgressAnalyzer -&gt; RecommendationService.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
